Newly stable API:

```rust
impl<T: 'static> LocalKey<Cell<T>> {
    pub fn update(&'static self, f: impl FnOnce(T) -> T)
    where
        T: Copy;
}
```

This matches the signature on `Cell`.

Closes: https://www.github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/143989 (Tracking issue)
